---
trigger: always_on
---
# Rule: Project Defaults (Always On)

## Project snapshot (source of truth)
- Language: Python 3.12
- Type: Dify plugin
- Entrypoint: main.py
- Plugin config: manifest.yaml
- Runtime deps: requirements.txt (pip)
- Dev deps: requirements-dev.txt (pip)
- Packaging: build_package.sh (if present) + dify-plugin CLI (CI workflow may package)

## Key runtime invariants (do not break)
- main.py MUST set telemetry env vars BEFORE importing mem0-related modules:
  - MEM0_TELEMETRY=False
  - POSTHOG_DISABLED=1
  - DO_NOT_TRACK=1
- Graceful shutdown is required:
  - atexit handler must remain registered
  - SIGTERM handler must call graceful shutdown and exit
  - KeyboardInterrupt must call graceful shutdown and exit

## Non-negotiables
- Plan-first for multi-file changes:
  - Before editing, propose a plan (<= 8 bullets) and list files to touch.
- Small diffs:
  - Prefer multiple small commits/PRs over one large change.
- Tests for behavior changes:
  - Any functional change must include/adjust pytest tests.
- No guessing:
  - Do not invent manifest fields or plugin schema; read repo files first.
  - Do not invent runtime deps; read requirements.txt first.
  - Do not invent dev deps; read requirements-dev.txt first.

## Local commands (macOS)
- Option A (recommended): uv
  - Create venv: uv venv
  - Activate: source .venv/bin/activate
  - Install runtime deps: uv pip install -r requirements.txt
  - Install dev deps: uv pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
  - Quick checks: uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format --check . && uv run pytest -q

- Option B: conda
  - Create env: conda create -n dify python=3.12
  - Activate: conda activate dify
  - Install runtime deps: pip install -r requirements.txt
  - Install dev deps: pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
  - Quick checks: ruff check . && ruff format --check . && pytest -q

- Option C: venv + pip
  - Create venv: python -m venv .venv
  - Activate: source .venv/bin/activate
  - Install runtime deps: pip install -r requirements.txt
  - Install dev deps: pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
  - Quick checks: ruff check . && ruff format --check . && pytest -q
